60b8-4482-99d1-71d3342c0ff8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"その部分に改行が入っていて欲しかった","ts":"1631166757.219900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qscGv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffcd0d08-e83e-4b94-bd96-67eefd7dbc8e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"書き方的に `autocmd-searchpat` とユーザー関数っていうのが1つの文脈だと思って見ていたけど、そうじゃなくてそこで切れていてユーザー定義関数の中ではダメ、っていう文脈かこれ\n（自己解決しました）","ts":"1631166734.219600","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1631166856.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5401r"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *:noh* *:nohlsearch*\n:noh[lsearch]           'hlsearch' オプションによる強調表示をやめます。検索コ\n                        マンドを使うか、'hlsearch' をオンに設定すると、再び強\n                        調表示されます。このコマンドは自動コマンド中は機能しま\n                        せん。自動コマンドを実行する時に強調表示の状態を保存\n                        し、実行後に元に戻すからです。|autocmd-searchpat|ユー\n                        ザー関数を呼び出したときも同様。\n \n'incsearch' オプションがオンの場合、検索パターンを入力している途中に、その時点\nでマッチしているものが強調表示されます。実際に、その場所にカーソルを移動させる\nには \u0026lt;CR\u0026gt; を打って検索を終了する必要があります。検索を中止するには \u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt; キー\nを使ってください。\n \n'hlsearch' オプションがオンの場合、最後に使った検索パターンは強調表示されます。\n|:nohlsearch| コマンドを使うと、一時的に強調表示をやめさせることができます。\n \n'shortmess' が \"S\" フラグを含まない場合、Vim はカーソルが位置するインデックス\nを自動的に表示します。これはこのように見えます:  \n \n  [1/5]         カーソルは 5 つのマッチの先頭に位置しています。\n  [1/\u0026gt;99]       カーソルは 99 より多いマッチの先頭に位置しています。\n  [\u0026gt;99/\u0026gt;99]     カーソルは 99 より多いマッチの 99 番目以降に位置しています。\n  [?/??]        いくつのマッチが存在しているのか不明です。検索の時間切れによっ\n                て統計が中断された場合に生成されます。\n \nNote: 総数はオフセットを考慮していません。\n \nマッチが見つからなかった場合はエラーが表示されます: *E486* Pattern not found\nNote: |:global| コマンドではこの動作はノーマルメッセージと同じです (Vi 互換の\nため)。|:s| コマンドでは \"e\" フラグを指定することでエラーメッセージを抑制でき\nます |:s_flags|。\n```","ts":"1631166203.218500","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"0c8b1af0-515d-40a8-a3db-50333cf6f09b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":":h nohlsearch","ts":"1631166202.218400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GzE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97ad5473-6ac8-4cd9-b78e-1c91183af6f7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"完全に別の質問なんですけど、nohlsearchを関数を呼び出すコマンド内で実行しても反映されないんですがこれって自動コマンド中ってやつでしょうか？\n```function! s:esc_esc() abort\n  nohlsearch\nendfunction\n\ncommand! EscEsc call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;esc_esc()\nnnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt; :\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;EscEsc\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;```","ts":"1631166198.218200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zLU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f1c4ccd-34e6-4773-8399-4e7ae2b8472f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、そうですね\n朝CocActionがasyncと勘違いしてcallbackを渡しており・・・","ts":"1631166131.217100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hmY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d757b116-e653-4665-a3e0-6316b9db6428","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"`CocActionAsync` もあります","ts":"1631166050.216600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7+Wq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60505c61-b921-4839-a59b-69cf206fb060","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今更ですけど、やってる感じCocCommandがasyncでCocActionがsyncっぽいですね","ts":"1631165797.216300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YgfV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ab4b8aa-7925-43fd-9d90-7b1e319e7e35","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"coc、async系のコマンドの挙動が急にぶっ壊れてfzf-previewの修正した記憶があるのでもしかしたらその辺で何かあったのかもしれないです","ts":"1631153103.215600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vxRk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57bb2d75-ccf6-47a1-92a7-269370517754","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ちゃんと書いてれば動いてくれてる感じがしたんですけど、最近になってたまにバグってvim再起動することがあってうーんってなってたんですよね\nなんでだろう・・・","ts":"1631152275.214700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iSkYU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1c0730a-a801-44b0-a8e0-8a85a1fcdc40","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"たしかにかなりややこしくなっていて意図がつかみにくい感じでしたね。何か理由があったのでしょうが。。。","ts":"1631152178.213900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Y=7="}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f20c7f6-94e5-42a3-a462-c7fcccddddf1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"それはそれとして、どうして動的autocmdなんてしたんだろう","ts":"1631152153.213400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3/s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd4d1b9c-6ba3-49ad-b8a5-0fdbd7967728","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```function! s:organize_import_and_eslint() abort\n  CocCommand editor.action.organizeImport\n  CocCommand eslint.executeAutofix\n  CocCommand prettier.formatFile\nendfunction```\nこれだけでいいかも","ts":"1631152129.213000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nDBm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdac018e-f62a-40d3-a051-036eb09c94b4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"CocCommand はそもそも Vim のコマンドみたいなのでどっちだとしてもコールバックは望めなそうです。","ts":"1631152060.212100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Xw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9057d857-67b3-41a1-94d7-1bd6196e6a1b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"CocCommand自体は同期非同期どっちでしたっけ・・・","ts":"1631152027.211600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tcG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf06b189-ebc9-4725-b835-da7f8f28eb35","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あれ、そっちにAsyncがあるんでしたっけ","ts":"1631152008.211200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5T="}]},{"client_msg_id":"418cad07-555f-4a9b-84f2-ab778b51d50e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e CocAction って同期っぽいですよ。コールバックで処理をしたいなら CocActionAsync を使うようです。","ts":"1631151994.210900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ho5S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2d72209-e782-4e82-b3c3-612cc49fc77b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"うーん、TextChangedにしないと動いてくれていない気がする？","ts":"1631151992.210800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+IryB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b87e839-8100-4328-8246-f26649f1645f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あれ、これだとなんか動かないな・・・","ts":"1631151813.209900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZtO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d14c373-c2ed-469d-9332-933f7fc92c8b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"一応、今こうしてみました\n```function! s:execute_prettier(...) abort\n  call CocAction('runCommand', 'prettier.formatFile')\nendfunction\n\nfunction! s:execute_eslint_fix_and_prettier(...) abort\n  call CocAction('runCommand', 'eslint.executeAutofix', function('\u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;execute_prettier'))\nendfunction\n\nfunction! s:organize_import_and_eslint() abort\n  call CocAction('runCommand', 'editor.action.organizeImport', function('\u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;execute_eslint_fix_and_prettier'))\nendfunction```","ts":"1631151443.209700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HD/QJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8ee63e7-d7bd-43af-a0a3-2cf590515051","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"一応やっておこう","ts":"1631151347.209500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rDjTo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e99b4032-e040-45ca-8ae7-3d3b6e20593c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これ、 `s:execute_eslint_fix_and_prettier`の中のCocCommandも非同期で走りそうだからそっちもcallbackにしないといけないのかなぁ","ts":"1631151332.209300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cV2+Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"807b0d25-711f-46b9-bf6d-d39ba956dcda","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"関数定義毎回走っちゃうから外出ししとくか・・・","ts":"1631151247.208400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZGs=4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f4ff3f4-d830-4493-9de9-3f80b74e706b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"いつどういう理由で書いたのか記憶喪失していたのでひとまず\n```function! s:organize_import_and_eslint() abort\n  function! s:execute_eslint_fix_and_prettier(...) abort\n    CocCommand eslint.executeAutofix\n    CocCommand prettier.formatFile\n  endfunction\n\n  call CocAction('runCommand', 'editor.action.organizeImport', function('\u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;execute_eslint_fix_and_prettier'))\nendfunction```\nしました","ts":"1631151229.208000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ml5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"672b7954-b80d-4f27-9f16-24333ed21621","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分なんか消えないことがあって","ts":"1631151165.207200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lAX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64e4c700-47b1-4ce9-87db-cdad7db404f4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"いや、callbackでautocmd!で削除してる予定でした","ts":"1631151156.207000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jXh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c330cb0d-f1de-41ad-bfbd-77c51e8ff7b3","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"これ一度実行すると、それ以降は TextChanged で毎度 eslint と prettier が自動で走るんでしょうか？","ts":"1631151049.206700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y7x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c52b7b2-cc1e-4272-9dc7-c2dcd6f93c46","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そもそもこういう動的autocmdってアンチパターン的なものだったりしますか？","ts":"1631150750.205800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L5/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"054e1f19-a6c5-4375-84e0-93c3c828dd23","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あれ、なんでこれcallbackで `\u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;execute_eslint_fix_and_prettier()` 呼ぶんじゃなくてTextChangedの登録にしたんだっけ・・・","ts":"1631150681.205300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1631150694.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/I3W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4e1231b-052d-4349-8304-5b92294497f5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Organize Importとeslintを順に走らせるためにこんな関数を用意してコマンドにして叩いてるんですけど、実行中に割り込んだ操作したときとか？にautocmdが消えないことがあるっぽくて `TextChanged * call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;execute_eslint_fix_and_prettier()` が残ってバグっちゃいます\n（確か）CocActionがasyncで走るからcallback関数渡して実行するようにしてるんですけど、なんかいい感じにする方法ってないでしょうか\n```function! s:organize_import_and_eslint() abort\n  augroup eslint_with_organize_import\n    autocmd!\n    autocmd TextChanged * call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;execute_eslint_fix_and_prettier()\n  augroup END\n\n  function! s:execute_eslint_fix_and_prettier() abort\n    CocCommand eslint.executeAutofix\n    CocCommand prettier.formatFile\n  endfunction\n\n  function! s:orgamize_import_callback(...) abort\n    autocmd! eslint_with_organize_import\n  endfunction\n\n  call CocAction('runCommand', 'editor.action.organizeImport', function('\u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;orgamize_import_callback'))\nendfunction```","ts":"1631150592.204800","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1631150621.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9r0FK"}]}]
